      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZINZAN SAMMY (1) stuck on well last time to finish a neck back in second (24.01) at this track in a Grade 5 over 425m. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Overdue and expected to feature again. CANDY POPS (3) was out of the placings last time when seventh at this track (24.51) but did record best time of the card when winning three back. Got the money at her only try from this box. Should be about the mark. WIZZIN' BY (2) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from six tries. Missed the frame latest (26.13) when fourth over 450m at Ballarat in a Grade 5. Makes strong appeal on best. SWEET MILLIE (6) cannot be underestimated.",
